{
  "method": "Causal, speed-free trip context plus same-person route-prefix contrasts. Training includes every eligible driving minute with a resolved next-encounter outcome, plus well-tracked no-encounter windows. Match the FIRST encountered station; every shorter encounter votes negative. Target lead 5\u201320 minutes. Fit on prior UTC days only; observed-segment weighted training. No raw speed, acceleration, slowing, or instantaneous nearest-station distance supplied to classifiers.",
  "caveats": "Station-duration proxy, sparse observation coverage, tiny account sample, exploratory reused snapshot. Tracked no-encounter windows are observational proxy negatives, not verified non-fueling. GPS gaps can split one real trip into several observed segments. No live notifications.",
